II. THE REFLEXIVE FINANCING TOPOLOGY, DOUBLE MARGINALIZATION & ZERO COMMON EQUITY FLOOR

The capital flow between hyperscalers, silicon lessors, and the standalone frontier lab forms a legal, self-reinforcing valuation loop:

```
