     TRIGGERS MATERIALIZED RISK DOCTRINE     TRIGGERS FIDUCIARY COMPLIANCE LOCKOUT
     (In re Facebook IPO; SEC v. Mylan)      (Institutional risk mandates restrict
     Exposes Underwriters to Section 11      buying $2T equity with active non-contract
     Claims via FRE 801(d)(2) Notice         tort exposure & 80% fixed take-or-pay debt)
